(2) MY DIRECTION A -- THE EXACT k-FOLD INDEPENDENCE CRITERION
    hhat kills any vector with a coordinate divisible by 7, so
        delta(S) = 0 EXACTLY  <=>  every n in Lam(a_S) has some 7 | n_i.
    That is a condition on Lam mod 7 -- a finite check.  At k=2 it
    reduces to 7|(a/g) or 7|(b/g), the S368 criterion.  Test at k=3:
    family            predict delta=0    |delta| measured
    (1, 7, 14)       True               0.00000000
    (7, 14, 21)      False              0.02970251
    (2, 3, 5)        False              0.01946605
    (7, 7, 7)        False              0.08347213
    (1, 2, 7)        False              0.00999811
    (7, 1, 2)        False              0.00999811
